WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.516 --> 00:00:18.584
Zann into Boz's room.

2
00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.886
He was hunched over his notebook, writing furiously.

3
00:00:21.906 --> 00:00:26.109
"I wish he would go back to the lab," Zann told his friends.

4
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.270
Perda sighed.

5
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.152
"We'll never save Ello if we're stuck here."

6
00:00:35.264 --> 00:00:38.827
The kids listened to some music until Boz poked his head into the room.

7
00:00:38.847 --> 00:00:40.989
"Keep it down in here.

8
00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:43.091
I'm trying to concentrate!"

9
00:00:43.111 --> 00:00:45.293
"Sorry," Zann said.

10
00:00:45.313 --> 00:00:47.535
"Um, can we go for a walk?"

11
00:00:48.796 --> 00:00:50.017
"All right," Boz said.

12
00:00:50.037 --> 00:00:51.538
"But don't be long.

13
00:00:52.099 --> 00:00:53.940
I'll conjure us some lunch in an hour."

14
00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.943
The four friends hurried outside.

15
00:00:58.184 --> 00:00:59.044
Perda groaned.

16
00:00:59.064 --> 00:01:02.888
"We only have an hour," she said.

17
00:01:03.384 --> 00:01:05.786
"That's not nearly enough time to save Ello."

18
00:01:06.987 --> 00:01:07.768
Zann nodded.

19
00:01:07.788 --> 00:01:10.490
"So let's do something else for an hour," he said.

20
00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:14.754
"Maybe Boz will decide we're safe on our own and then go to the lab after lunch."

21
00:01:15.954 --> 00:01:17.176
Gliss looked at Darb.

22
00:01:17.516 --> 00:01:21.339
"That Void Rights meeting should be starting around now," she said.

23
00:01:21.359 --> 00:01:27.264
"What if Mari was right, and there really are new ways for Voids to get magic?"

24
00:01:28.225 --> 00:01:29.706
Darb stared at the ground.

25
00:01:29.726 --> 00:01:32.048
"That might be interesting," he mumbled.

26
00:01:32.876 --> 00:01:33.597
Perda shrugged.

27
00:01:33.617 --> 00:01:35.057
"Let's check it out."

28
00:01:35.938 --> 00:01:38.379
"Do you really think Gliss and I will be welcome there?"

29
00:01:38.679 --> 00:01:40.060
Zann pointed to his hair.

30
00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:44.523
"I wish I knew how to do a Masking spell," Perda said.

31
00:01:44.543 --> 00:01:46.784
"What's a Masking spell?"

32
00:01:47.064 --> 00:01:47.725
Zann asked.

33
00:01:47.745 --> 00:01:52.847
"I read about it in an old book in the Swamp Bottom library," Perda said.

34
00:01:52.867 --> 00:01:56.109
"The spell was discovered in another world.

35
00:01:56.530 --> 00:02:00.492
It can make a person look exactly how he or she wants to look.

36
00:02:01.096 --> 00:02:03.037
You two could get rid of your red hair."

37
00:02:03.057 --> 00:02:07.139
"I'll just conjure a wig for myself," Gliss said.

38
00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.180
Zann conjured a large hat.

39
00:02:15.362 --> 00:02:18.703
The meeting had already started when Zann and his friends arrived.

40
00:02:19.784 --> 00:02:21.745
A large crowd filled the room.

41
00:02:22.665 --> 00:02:27.327
Several people stood on the stage, including a young man with wild black hair.

42
00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:29.868
Perda had noticed someone else.

43
00:02:30.336 --> 00:02:31.357
She elbowed Zann.

44
00:02:31.377 --> 00:02:33.999
"Look, there's Jev," she whispered.

45
00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:35.820
Zann looked.

46
00:02:36.261 --> 00:02:38.963
Jev was standing near the stage with his parents.

47
00:02:39.983 --> 00:02:43.826
"Now we'll demonstrate some of the Void magic we just told you about!"

48
00:02:44.026 --> 00:02:45.868
the young man with the black hair announced.

49
00:02:45.888 --> 00:02:49.310
"Void magic," Gliss repeated softly.

50
00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.012
"I guess Mari knew what she was talking about."

51
00:02:53.093 --> 00:02:56.756
Zann nodded and watched as the young man held up a wooden cane.

52
00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:01.405
"This came from a world called Atmo," the man said.

53
00:03:01.425 --> 00:03:04.686
"It allows someone to leap long distances."

54
00:03:04.706 --> 00:03:09.707
"Atmo is the world my parents were talking about," Zann whispered to his friends.

55
00:03:09.727 --> 00:03:13.448
"I wonder how these people got their hands on stuff from other worlds."

56
00:03:14.649 --> 00:03:19.230
He watched as the young man used the cane to leap from one end of the room to

57
00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:19.670
the other.

58
00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:21.671
The crowd gasped.

59
00:03:22.191 --> 00:03:25.772
After that the young man and his friends showed off some other items.

60
00:03:26.668 --> 00:03:31.309
They had a canteen that stayed full no matter how much someone drank from it.

61
00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:38.171
They displayed a shirt that could expand or contract to fit anyone of any size.

62
00:03:39.191 --> 00:03:42.292
Two of the presenters held up a pile of rubbery fabric.

63
00:03:42.312 --> 00:03:46.833
"This is a boat that comes to life without magic," one announced.

64
00:03:46.853 --> 00:03:49.514
"I'm a Void, and even I can make it work.

65
00:03:49.874 --> 00:03:53.155
Watch!" The Void pulled a little tab.

66
00:03:53.575 --> 00:03:56.416
The audience gasped again as the fabric expanded.

67
00:03:57.168 --> 00:04:00.051
A minute later it had taken the form of a small boat.

68
00:04:00.071 --> 00:04:02.473
"Wow!" someone cried.

69
00:04:02.493 --> 00:04:04.254
"How did you do that?"

70
00:04:05.035 --> 00:04:06.136
The young man smiled.

71
00:04:06.156 --> 00:04:09.659
"Once Laddno is king, he'll explain everything.

72
00:04:10.179 --> 00:04:16.044
He already vowed to share all this magic and more with everyone—including Voids."

73
00:04:17.285 --> 00:04:18.866
Cheers rang out around the room.

74
00:04:18.886 --> 00:04:25.712
"Laddno will have control of all those relics from the Cave of the Unknown," the man continued.

75
00:04:26.632 --> 00:04:30.694
"And he will share that immense power with everyone in Magica.

76
00:04:31.174 --> 00:04:36.416
The Red Council will no longer be allowed to hoard the relics for its own purposes."

77
00:04:36.436 --> 00:04:40.298
"That's not what the Red Council is doing," Zann muttered.

78
00:04:40.318 --> 00:04:43.619
"Soon we'll have magic of our own!"

79
00:04:43.859 --> 00:04:45.220
an excited Void shouted.

80
00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.421
"Hooray for Laddno!"

81
00:04:47.441 --> 00:04:50.322
"Hooray for Laddno!"

82
00:04:50.482 --> 00:04:51.523
several others cried.

83
00:04:52.723 --> 00:04:54.464
Then a man raised his hand.

84
00:04:54.996 --> 00:04:58.860
"But I heard the Red Council is trying to destroy all the relics.

85
00:05:00.801 --> 00:05:04.004
What if the members succeed before Laddno takes power?"

86
00:05:04.024 --> 00:05:07.468
"No!" several people shouted.

87
00:05:07.488 --> 00:05:11.071
"Maybe we should storm that lab right now!"

88
00:05:11.431 --> 00:05:12.072
someone yelled.

89
00:05:13.173 --> 00:05:15.895
A few people cheered, though others looked troubled.

90
00:05:17.256 --> 00:05:18.037
Zann gulped.

91
00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:20.840
Should he zap to the lab to warn his parents?

92
00:05:21.728 --> 00:05:24.931
He started rubbing his fingers together just in case.

93
00:05:26.052 --> 00:05:29.254
But the young man onstage raised both hands for attention.

94
00:05:29.274 --> 00:05:32.517
"That might not be necessary," he said.

95
00:05:32.537 --> 00:05:39.523
"Laddno is working on something big—something that could render the relics unnecessary."

96
00:05:41.004 --> 00:05:43.226
Murmurs arose from all around the room.

97
00:05:44.467 --> 00:05:47.629
Zann couldn't help feeling curious about Laddno's work himself.

98
00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.432
The young man smiled at the crowd.

99
00:05:51.016 --> 00:05:54.559
"Surely everyone here has heard the tales from the Old Times," he said.

100
00:05:54.579 --> 00:05:57.421
"Including stories about the Source?"

101
00:05:58.681 --> 00:05:59.442
Zann blinked.

102
00:06:00.183 --> 00:06:00.783
The Source?

103
00:06:01.303 --> 00:06:04.786
That sounded familiar, but he couldn't quite remember what it was.

104
00:06:04.806 --> 00:06:10.370
"The Source is where all of Magica gets its magic," the man said.

105
00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:14.593
"It's where our world's native magical power comes from.

106
00:06:14.613 --> 00:06:21.717
It's where that power is stored until you snap your fingers or rub your hands together to summon

107
00:06:21.757 --> 00:06:26.358
it." "But I thought the Source was a myth," a woman called out.

108
00:06:27.418 --> 00:06:28.599
The young man smiled.

109
00:06:28.619 --> 00:06:30.159
"I did too.

110
00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.240
But Laddno knew better.

111
00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.921
He's sure he can find the Source and figure out how to control it.

112
00:06:38.022 --> 00:06:40.783
That way he can share its power fairly."

113
00:06:41.943 --> 00:06:43.583
He clasped his hands together.

114
00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:45.064
"Just think!

115
00:06:45.656 --> 00:06:52.519
Soon every Void in Magica will have as much access to magical energy as the most powerful Magic

116
00:06:52.619 --> 00:06:56.221
Masters!" "Hooray for Laddno!"

117
00:06:56.441 --> 00:06:57.461
someone shouted again.

118
00:06:57.481 --> 00:07:00.943
The room erupted with cheers and excitement.

119
00:07:01.963 --> 00:07:03.644
Darb leaned closer to Zann.

120
00:07:03.664 --> 00:07:05.405
"Can we get out of here?"

121
00:07:05.785 --> 00:07:06.305
he whispered.

122
00:07:07.366 --> 00:07:09.867
Zann nodded, already backing toward the door.

123
00:07:09.887 --> 00:07:12.028
"Exactly what I was thinking."
